Name: second paragraph of a list item (bug#82076)

=-=
- User enters email and password -- password is EXPIRED.

  @Usually because they have been issued a temporary password, and have to create a real one before using the application. Password expiration on a schedule (e.g.
  every 30 days, every 3 months) is NOT required, which
  also means we don't need to check their password against previous passwords.
=-=
- User enters email and password -- password is EXPIRED.

  Usually because they have been issued a temporary password, and have
  to create a real one before using the application. Password
  expiration on a schedule (e.g.  every 30 days, every 3 months) is
  NOT required, which also means we don't need to check their password
  against previous passwords.
=-=-=

